@template steady

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- You missed a shift. It happens. Make tomorrow a good one.

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- The Chief told you what needs to change. It isn't much. You can do it.   #warm

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- Hard week? Sit a minute. Then let's work out how you get to your shift.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- One day at a time, {nick}. Tomorrow's the only one that matters.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- That's better. Steady does it.

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- I'm sorry it came to this. You're still the same person to me.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Go steady. You'll find your place. I believe that.   #warm
